A small, dependency-free peer-to-peer transport for already-paired peers:
sealed-envelope delivery over the local network (mDNS) and directly over the
internet (STUN + UDP hole punching), with an authenticated identify handshake.
It carries opaque bytes; the application owns the encryption and the key exchange.
